# "Your first ten minutes" — the first stored program in the guide.
#
# INPUT stops the program and prints its own `?` prompt, so the wait pattern
# has to match either that or the OK prompt: RUN lands on the `?`, and the
# answer below lands on OK.

wait (OK|\?)
send ADA\r
expect ^HELLO, ADA$
expect ^WELCOME TO YOUR ACE\.$
